      "title": {
        "en": "Experience Cards",
        "zh": "经验卡库"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Turn repeated agent mistakes into small cards. A hit injects only a one-line pointer and is resolved locally — on a hit, roughly 83–90% fewer tokens — with a community card library you can pull from and contribute to.",
        "zh": "把 agent 反复踩的坑变成小卡片；命中一张时只注入一行提示、由钩子本地解决，约省 83%~90% token；社区卡库可拉取、可贡献。"
      },
